value.LIGHT_DENOISE.1=Temporal
value.LIGHT_DENOISE.2=Temporal + Spatial
option.LIGHT_ENTITY_OCCLUSION=Entity Occlusion
option.LIGHT_ENTITY_OCCLUSION.comment=Mobs and block entities block placed light sources. Renders entities in the shadow pass (costly).
option.LIGHT_PLAYER_OCCLUSION=Player Occlusion
option.LIGHT_PLAYER_OCCLUSION.comment=Your player blocks placed light sources.
option.LIGHT_OCCLUSION_MODE=Entity Occlusion Method
option.LIGHT_OCCLUSION_MODE.comment=How players and mobs block light. Voxel: half-block boxes (fast, blocky shadows). Triangle: the actual model shape, including transparent parts.
