option.CLOUD_ALTITUDE.comment=Custom height template only. World y of the low cloud base
option.CLOUD_THICKNESS=Low Cloud Thickness
option.CLOUD_THICKNESS.comment=Custom height template only. Blocks for the cumulus layer (real 4.5 km). Also sets the scale of every layer left on automatic
option.CLOUD_C_LOW=Climate: Low Cloud Amount
option.CLOUD_C_LOW.comment=Custom climate only. Average low cloud cover (varies by day)
option.CLOUD_C_CONVECTION=Climate: Convection
option.CLOUD_C_CONVECTION.comment=Custom climate only. How tall cumulus grow on sunny afternoons
option.CLOUD_C_STRATUS=Climate: Stratocumulus
option.CLOUD_C_STRATUS.comment=Custom climate only. How often clouds spread into flat layers on humid days and at night
option.CLOUD_C_MID=Climate: Mid Cloud Amount
option.CLOUD_C_HIGH=Climate: High Cloud Amount
option.CLOUD_C_STORMS=Climate: Fair Weather Storms
option.CLOUD_C_STORMS.comment=Custom climate only. Chance of distant cumulonimbus on unstable afternoons (thunderstorms always make them)
option.CLOUD_CUMULONIMBUS=Cumulonimbus
option.CLOUD_CUMULONIMBUS.comment=Thunderstorm towers with anvils, overshooting tops, mammatus and rain shafts. Only costs while storms exist
option.CLOUD_SPEED=Cloud Speed
option.CLOUD_MULTISCATTER=Multiple Scattering Octaves
option.CLOUD_CIRRUS=High Clouds
option.CLOUD_CIRRUS.comment=Thin translucent ice clouds around 9 km: cirrus tufts with sheared fall streaks, cirrocumulus ripples and cirrostratus veils (faint 22 degree halo)
option.CLOUD_CIRRUS_COVERAGE=High Cloud Amount
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS=Cloud Shadows
option.CLOUD_LOW_COVERAGE=Low Cloud Coverage
