option.CLOUD_LOW_DENSITY=Low Cloud Density
option.CLOUD_LOW_DENSITY.comment=Optical density of low clouds. The default 0.25 is soft with translucent edges, 1.0 is the previous default, 3.0 the older dense look. Rain and storm clouds scale with it. Shading (lit side and dark base) is kept at low values
option.CLOUD_LOW_SCALE=Low Cloud Size
option.CLOUD_LOW_SCALE.comment=Horizontal size multiplier for low clouds only (on top of Cloud Scale)
option.CLOUD_LOW_EROSION=Low Cloud Erosion
option.CLOUD_LOW_EROSION.comment=How strongly billows and wisps cut into the edges. Lower gives smooth cotton, higher gives cauliflower tops and ragged bases
option.CLOUD_LOW_WIND=Low Wind Speed
option.CLOUD_LOW_WIND.comment=m/s at the low cloud level (multiplied by Cloud Speed)
option.CLOUD_LOW_WIND_ANGLE=Low Wind Direction
