option.LENS_GHOSTS.comment=Internal reflections, computed from a ray-traced lens design: aperture shape, coating color and dispersion. Ghosts get clipped as the light moves to the edge
option.LENS_SCREEN_FLARE=Bright Pixel Flare
option.LENS_SCREEN_FLARE.comment=Ghosts and horizontal streaks from bright pixels such as torches and lava (needs Bloom)
option.LENS_STARBURST=Starburst
option.LENS_STARBURST.comment=Diffraction rays from the aperture blades. Even blade counts give that many rays, odd counts twice as many
option.LENS_HALO=Halo
option.LENS_HALO.comment=Rainbow ring around the image center
option.LENS_DIRT=Lens Dirt
option.LENS_DIRT.comment=Dust and fingerprints on the front element light up near bright lights
option.LENS_VEILING_GLARE=Veiling Glare
option.LENS_VEILING_GLARE.comment=Scattering inside the lens adds a haze and lowers contrast against the light
option.LENS_DISTORTION=Distortion
option.LENS_DISTORTION.comment=Barrel / pincushion / mustache distortion (Brown-Conrady) and the fisheye projection. Off keeps the game's straight-line image
option.LENS_DISTORTION_SCALE=Distortion Strength
option.LENS_DISTORTION_SCALE.comment=1 = as computed from the lens prescription (the Flektogon's mustache is about 2%, subtle). Raise it to exaggerate. Does not change the fisheye projection
option.LENS_FISHEYE_FIT=Fisheye Framing
option.LENS_FISHEYE_FIT.comment=How the fisheye fits the screen. Fill Corners = no black areas (slightly tighter view). Fit Width = closest to the real lens, corners outside the rendered view turn black
value.LENS_FISHEYE_FIT.0=Fill Corners
value.LENS_FISHEYE_FIT.1=Fit Width
option.LENS_WARP_IN_TAA=Build Distortion In TAA
option.LENS_WARP_IN_TAA.comment=Where the fisheye / distortion image is built. Final stretches the finished image, so the fisheye center (magnified about 2.5x at FOV 110) looks soft. TAA builds it from the jittered frames, so the center regains fine detail while standing still or turning slowly (fast motion looks like Final). Costs about the same as Final (about 1 ms more in a test at 1038x938). Auto = TAA for the fisheye and strong distortion. Needs TAA
value.LENS_WARP_IN_TAA.0=Auto
value.LENS_WARP_IN_TAA.1=Final (stretch)
value.LENS_WARP_IN_TAA.2=TAA
option.LENS_CHROMATIC=Lateral Chromatic Aberration
option.LENS_CHROMATIC.comment=Rainbow fringes toward the image edges (wavelength sampled)
option.LENS_AXIAL_CA=Axial Chromatic Aberration
option.LENS_AXIAL_CA.comment=Purple fringes on foreground bokeh, green on background bokeh (needs Depth of Field)
option.LENS_SOFT_FOCUS=Spherical Aberration Glow
